{"seq":1,"slug":"father-of-philosophy","title":"Father Of Philosophy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/father-of-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-socratic-turn","title":"苏格拉底式转向","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/father-of-philosophy/the-socratic-turn","wordCount":2211,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"pre-and-post-socratic","title":"前苏格拉底与后苏格拉底","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/father-of-philosophy/pre-and-post-socratic","wordCount":2137,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现苏格拉底作为&quot;哲学之父&quot;的奠基性影响。&quot;苏格拉底式转向&quot;——将哲学从自然引向人，开创了西方哲学的人文传统，成为一个永恒的方向。正是基于这一转向，后世以苏格拉底为界，将古希腊哲学划分为&quot;前苏格拉底&quot;与&quot;后苏格拉底&quot;两个时期。本章揭示苏格拉底在西方哲学发展中的枢纽地位。</p>\n"}